 ```
 
 For extension types, see [extensions.md](extensions.md) for the full API.
+
+## Instruction scope
+
+
+`getAgentsFiles().agentsFiles` and `BuildSystemPromptOptions.contextFiles` carry
+loader provenance in `scope`: `{ kind: "global" }` for the agent-directory file,
+or `{ kind: "workspace", directory }` for each ancestor file. Both stock and
+custom system prompts render these as `global_instructions` and
+`workspace_instructions` under a neutral `instruction_context` wrapper.
+SDK-supplied files without scope receive a neutral `instructions` tag.
+Instruction content is preserved verbatim; path attributes are escaped.
